# Committed on purpose: these are the PUBLIC client values, inlined into the
# browser bundle at build time either way. Real secrets stay in the untracked
# .env / Worker secrets.
#
# Why this file exists: PUBLIC_* vars are baked in by Vite at BUILD time, while
# wrangler.jsonc "vars" only cover the SERVER at runtime. When the two disagreed,
# the server talked to the right Supabase project while the browser talked to a
# different (later deleted) one, and login broke with an unresolvable host.
# Keep these in sync with the "vars" block in wrangler.jsonc.
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://iarlunyimplczudavrcl.supabase.co
